 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Dakota sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "Dakota seems lighter — something good landed recently."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "They glance toward the fire, toward the others — checking who's listening."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Oh.\" A long pause. \"I didn't think it was anyone's. It's gone — I ate it days ago. I'm sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"I'm not okay. I'm saying it out loud so it's real: I'm not okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "They lean back on their hands. \"Wind's up tonight. Good night to not be walking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"I keep waiting for it to get worse again. It hasn't. Not while you're here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Still on that hard time. Anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "Something eases in their shoulders. They're really talking to you now."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Howard is gone and Scarlett is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Thanks for... you know. Just listening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"They'd tell me to keep working. So I'm working. That's the whole plan.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Hear me out — Most days I don't think about it. Today I am. Appreciate you noticing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"That again?\" Javier sighs. \"I confessed that already. I'm not confessing it twice for dramatic effect.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Heh. Nobody's asked me that in a while. ...I'm alright. Getting there.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Howard is gone and Scarlett is gone. The fire doesn't care. That's what gets me — the fire doesn't care.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"I'd love to. Lead the way.\" (They're already checking your pack.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"I… Have you — sorry. I keep thinking about them.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Come get air with me. I need to think out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "It's quiet at the ridge. Nathan doesn't say much. Sometimes that's the whole point."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "A long exhale. \"I'll get there. Just needed a minute where I didn't have to be fine.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"We lost Howard and Scarlett this week. I keep setting out extra portions. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Out there? With YOU leading? ...Let me think about it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "You show them Wood Sorrel — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Let me sit with all that. We'll pick it up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Every laugh out there feels wrong today. Then I feel wrong for thinking it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Come get air with me. I need to think out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "Habib shows you where they go to think. \"Don't tell the others. Everyone needs one place.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Hah. Thanks. ...Thanks for saying that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"We lost Howard and Scarlett. I do the headcount without thinking. Then I think.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"I could talk all day, but — go on. We'll talk more.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"You look handy. What did you do with your hands, before?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"Useful. Everything useful matters now. I mean that as a compliment. Trust me. Mostly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"These hands? Florist hands. Clipboards, mostly. Now they hold wire and wood, and they learn fast. Hands are honest that way.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"Still on what you did with your hands.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"Scarlett is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"A name. Okay.\" You say it out loud, trying the shape of it:"
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "🤝 \"The Company.\" It hangs in the air a moment — then Dakota grins. It's real now. It has a name, which means it can be lost."
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "🤝 Dakota is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"We bury, we grieve, we keep going. There's no step four.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "You show them Wood Sorrel — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about grief — we wandered off it, 4 days back. 'Heh. Nobody's asked me that in a while. ...I'm alright. Getting there.' We still owe what's been happening a proper ending, too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"You're kind. Don't let this place change that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Scarlett owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"Nobody says Scarlett's name right yet. We will. Give it a few days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "Dakota nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 23,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"About that question — Got a read on anyone here yet? Who should I be watching?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"Same. But keep your eyes open — some people here are performing, not surviving.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "The warmth pulls back a notch. They're weighing something."
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"Still on your read on people here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? You'll see.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"Have you heard what they're calling tick? Javier is pushing 'Ugly-Eyes'. Everyone's got a name for it and nobody agrees.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "Javier nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"That's the whole of it. Sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"The pantry's nearly bare. Come forage with me tomorrow — two of us can fill packs.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"Another day like today and we're choosing who eats. Nobody's worked the water chestnut patch past the treeline in days. We'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"The whole fire was arguing about tick last night — what to even CALL it. 'The Ugly Beast' got shouted down. What's your vote?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"We'll land on something. We always do — usually the loudest person's idea.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"I listen to everyone and nod. It's a strategy. Probably.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"I wish we had longer. Soon, yeah?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"About the pantry run — still on my mind. I keep coming back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"I did the count twice. The count doesn't change. Meet me at the far treeline, past the rocks and we'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "As I said — Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"They took you — The Oath, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "Dakota nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"That's... pretty much all of it, honestly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to that foraging help.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"So. Can I tell you something? I'm keeping a photo of someone I left behind. I haven't told anyone.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"Help me haul something back? Too much for one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "Ramatu shows you where they go to think. \"Don't tell the others. Everyone needs one place.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"Short version — Still on what they confided.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"Any regrets? The real kind, not the small stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "Quiet. \"Yeah. I think everyone's carrying one of those.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 46,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  }
 ],
