    "bearerSample": [
     "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Scarlett Ahmed is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
     "SCARLETT — GONE. 1 open question closed unanswered.",
     "🕯️ Scarlett Ahmed is dead — a stranger. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging."
    ],
    "giftSample": [
     "💛 You hold Carpenter's square. Your first solo frame, checked and found true. The nod that followed was the whole ceremony. Measure twice, cut once — it's in your hands now. Your gifts are not master",
     "Travel 3 tiles to forest floor.\n— Under the canopy —\nFallen trunks lie like sleeping animals, furred with moss. The ground gives underfoot — centuries of leaf-mold.",
     "📖 LEARNED: Animal Behavior (Level 1). Most animals flee. Give them an escape route and they take it. Cornered animals fight."
    ],
    "rumorSample": [],
    "crisisSample": [
     "📡 The System, casual as a knife: \"So. The pods. We could... discuss them. A favor for a peek? A peek for a promise? We LOVE a bargain. The audience LOVES a bargain. What's a little debt between frien",
     "(Bargain — owe the System a favor — or don't.)",
     "◈ HAVEN — You've noticed: people cover for each other without being asked. The gaps close themselves."
    ]
   }
  },
