    "giftSample": [
     "💛 You hold Photo album. Faces from before. Eloá's wedding. Your dad asleep in the chair. The neighbor's kid with the missing tooth. The most valuable thing you own, and it weighs nothing. Your gifts ",
     "Javier watches you give the order. \"Interesting. Nobody asked me.\"",
     "\"Got it,\" Javier says flatly. \"Orders are orders. Whoever gives them.\""
    ],
    "rumorSample": [
     "⚔️ Ramatu killed the Callback with their party — 12 rounds, 63 taken. Word travels fast. Took Contract Quill off the body. The village cheers.",
     "⚔️ Nathan killed the Ugly-Eyes with their party — 3 rounds, 9 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers.",
     "⚔️ Chantal killed the Ugly Beast with their party — 6 rounds, 21 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."
