    "otherN": 287,
    "bearerSample": [
     "You catch fragments by the fire — Quinn telling Aroha about Habib. The story's getting bigger than what happened.",
     "💧 Quinn returns with water: +2 clean.",
     "👥 Quinn heads out to forage. \"Out for a forage. If I'm late, start without me.\" The pantry won't fill itself."
    ],
    "giftSample": [
     "🍽️ Aroha taps the pantry door — full to bursting — and keeps the day's share in hand. \"Dinner's on me tonight, then.\"",
     "At the grave, Chantal speaks for Nathan — \"Ramatu trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."
    ],
    "rumorSample": [
     "A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.",
     "🧳 A trader lingers after the meal — your fire eats well, and word travels with full bellies. \"East, past the river — three fires walk as ONE now. They've got a speaker for SPEAKERS. Thought you shoul"
    ],
    "crisisSample": [
     "🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer.",
     "💬 Ramatu pulls you aside. \"I need to tell you something. Last night I... dreamed? No. I was AWAKE. And something spoke to me. Not the System — something else. It said: 'Tell the human to watch the no",
     "Another face surfaces — someone you brought, or someone who brought you. ‘You didn’t think we’d come alone?’ The dead gather. (Allied monsters +4 damage, 2 turns.)"
    ]
   },
   "eventClass": "handoff"
  }
