 "pdCallTexts": [
  {
   "deadId": "gen_m96x1xa",
   "entryDay": 16,
   "cause": "the wild",
   "lines": [
    "d16: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Howard Silverman is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
    "d16: Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight.",
    "d16: 🕯️ Howard Silverman is dead — the wild. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.",
    "d16: What Howard kept close goes into the ground with them — keepsakes are buried, never taken from the body.",
    "d16: \"Howard's gone.\" Jorge looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Howard.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face.",
    "d16: The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Scarlett blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers.",
    "d16: 📖 LEARNED: Scrounger (Level 1). Ruin looting finds +1 item.",
    "d16: 📖 LEARNED: Debris Shelter (Level 1). A lean-to of branches and leaves beats nothing. Dead air is insulation.",
    "d16: 📖 LEARNED: Reading People (Level 1). Microexpressions leak truth. Watch the eyes, not the mouth. People tell you who they are.",
    "d16: ⚡ TECHNIQUE UNLOCKED: Deep Read! You don't just read trust — you read intent. Know what they'll do next. (Your knowledge of Reading People amplifies your open_book.)",
    "d16: 📖 LEARNED: Wound Care (Level 1). Clean it, close it, cover it. Pressure stops bleeding. Clean water is better than dirty hands.",
    "d16: ⚡ TECHNIQUE UNLOCKED: Precise Mend! Your healing knows where to go. +50% effectiveness. (Your knowledge of Wound Care amplifies your field_medicine.)",
