  "lastSay": [
   "d52: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Quinn Murphy is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d52: Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight.",
   "d52: 🕯️ Quinn Murphy is dead — the wild. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.",
   "d52: What Quinn kept close goes into the ground with them — keepsakes are buried, never taken from the body.",
   "d52: No one is left to pick up the Codex. The village dies out — quietly, the way villages do. The season ends here."
  ]
